{
  "_readme": "OpenCode asks for typed values in a native form (form.created). The Worker reads a form that is no question of the question tool into an MCP elicitation prompt: a JSON Schema with one property for each field, and a rule for each field that states whether the form hides it and which earlier answers it needs. The browser's shared form then draws that prompt and builds the answer. Each case states a stored payload, the prompt that the Worker records for it, and what the shared form shows and sends for some answers. TestReadControlRequest_FormPromptConformance (backend/internal/worker/agent/providers/opencode) reads each payload and requires the stated prompt. formPromptConformance.test.ts (frontend/src/components/chat/providers/opencode) fills the form of each prompt and requires the stated fields and answers. A change to either half therefore fails a case here.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a required text field with an empty default needs a value",
      "payload": {
        "type": "form.created",
        "data": { "form": { "fields": [{ "key": "empty", "type": "string", "required": true, "default": "" }] } }
      },
      "prompt": {"editorPurpose":"CONTROL_EDITOR_PURPOSE_NONE","elicitation":{"mode":"form","schemaJson":"{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"empty\":{\"default\":\"\",\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1}},\"required\":[\"empty\"]}","fieldRules":[{"key":"empty"}]}},
      "reads": [{ "answers": {}, "error": true }]
    },
